## Stateless Worker Pattern
### Fetch context from shared store
### Act and save results
### Any worker picks up any job
## Three-Tier State Storage
### Hot: Redis (ephemeral session)
### Warm: Postgres (durable results)
### Cold: S3 (large artifacts)
## Message Queues
### Backpressure buffer
### Cost control via worker count
### Priority lanes
### Dead letter queues
## Cost & Fairness
